    "version_id": "478b30de-14b3-42de-846f-7609dcd29822",
    "revision": 1,
    "raw_sha256": "5aa51f5816ec39ac4eefd7a8299def081d33a2277a8fdddb66243b4a741c7591",
    "normalized_sha256": "5aa51f5816ec39ac4eefd7a8299def081d33a2277a8fdddb66243b4a741c7591",
    "normalization_version": "utf8-newlines-v1",
    "parser_version": "blocks-v1",
    "units": [
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "0a1698ed-e1e0-42f9-85b9-ad06d57b53d1",
        "ordinal": 0,
        "start_byte": 0,
        "end_byte": 36,
        "text_sha256": "fec65947daad2a54333e928158460993dfc9421f75606bd1b09b7eba99d729a4",
        "text": "# 纸灯箱 R7：虚构运行规则\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "9206da12-0543-4995-872e-63c8e31d041c",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "start_byte": 36,
        "end_byte": 37,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "cb5ce23b-c65d-4b32-95b8-17b3223d8bb5",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "start_byte": 37,
        "end_byte": 173,
        "text_sha256": "f958363f7ea6f3e191eb3e395f7884aa82077d4df1b9699943a58f861239848b",
        "text": "本材料由测试作者自造；设备、名称和数值均为虚构，仅用于核对文本抽取，不是实际设备使用说明。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "c357626e-cd27-48d4-a069-7e497db1fe7a",
        "ordinal": 3,
        "start_byte": 173,
        "end_byte": 174,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "7ffddf0f-2616-45be-8f5f-6a7f15f3e397",
        "ordinal": 4,
        "start_byte": 174,
        "end_byte": 187,
        "text_sha256": "98b7c6fd7d764e95f962fb97364b71c24ae937a06b14fd1bd35917be3df26564",
        "text": "## 启动前\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "39f9a7e8-cf73-49f5-adaf-501d92e93375",
        "ordinal": 5,
        "start_byte": 187,
        "end_byte": 188,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "215b2d89-fcff-48e7-901a-2fa27e3ed8b8",
        "ordinal": 6,
        "start_byte": 188,
        "end_byte": 261,
        "text_sha256": "ea830f979af11b29db8dbf4e5941ff78a518ff71199a515047fe7241bfe2e921",
        "text": "纸灯箱 R7 的额定输入电压为 12 V，仅适用于直流供电。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "7d05d1a4-82d7-4ad5-b957-0fe9a4219a4f",
        "ordinal": 7,
        "start_byte": 261,
        "end_byte": 262,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "b8bb9c0c-93a4-450f-af5e-2140bd6f50a8",
        "ordinal": 8,
        "start_byte": 262,
        "end_byte": 352,
        "text_sha256": "fc51d0840ecb48caab2af5ef9c8596c9dde883731f403a8ff74a86da7f5afb01",
        "text": "启动前，箱内纸片总质量必须不超过 80 g；这里不计包装袋的质量。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "1a400618-ae22-4035-a3f5-6db341b4df5a",
        "ordinal": 9,
        "start_byte": 352,
        "end_byte": 353,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "e49a9511-c679-4733-b1b6-7f2bf15d7137",
        "ordinal": 10,
        "start_byte": 353,
        "end_byte": 408,
        "text_sha256": "5169f5fe6d3ecfdf1c177b7af42c38ea7c3e3ff9a85bd3129f9c22153e52ea2b",
        "text": "只有箱盖完全闭合时，主灯才允许启动。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "542b0e4c-a668-4ca2-9798-2f404430fe9c",
        "ordinal": 11,
        "start_byte": 408,
        "end_byte": 409,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "b16f76c7-857c-4bc3-849d-67ddd4e870af",
        "ordinal": 12,
        "start_byte": 409,
        "end_byte": 492,
        "text_sha256": "d7b0c7183b7447e91e8b3f623a36a189ae12eeb7ac6062aa01ad0db3afa6fdff",
        "text": "按下绿色键并保持 2 s 才执行一次启动；短于 2 s 的按压无效。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "f16520ae-b8e3-4368-b6c1-7f3b544dee7c",
        "ordinal": 13,
        "start_byte": 492,
        "end_byte": 493,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "ae7f362e-03a5-4bbc-9256-debcb9bd8b0c",
        "ordinal": 14,
        "start_byte": 493,
        "end_byte": 506,
        "text_sha256": "082b739b971723b554b8d34295051f86c9a34851a29a15be0703abb9349bd4a6",
        "text": "## 运行中\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "f12e7d56-386f-4e99-a84f-70aaeb9ca8ca",
        "ordinal": 15,
        "start_byte": 506,
        "end_byte": 507,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "36edd70f-3cca-407e-9e59-1e96172196d4",
        "ordinal": 16,
        "start_byte": 507,
        "end_byte": 596,
        "text_sha256": "0d6f50c897a7460afc2d623aff02544ac7383a56299fad9dfcde1f664f7145a9",
        "text": "当环境温度为 10–30 °C（含端点）时，连续运行时长上限为 40 min。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "d2669465-a0ae-45a2-8480-023729d0f4f4",
        "ordinal": 17,
        "start_byte": 596,
        "end_byte": 597,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "966bc0d7-3d9e-49cc-815c-fdb4b6c07309",
        "ordinal": 18,
        "start_byte": 597,
        "end_byte": 686,
        "text_sha256": "2e6753ffd26718779246792869b93995f899486b583c6ca804038af121aa13ea",
        "text": "若环境温度高于 30 °C，应停止点灯；仅状态指示灯允许继续亮起。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "74e7a00e-d665-4976-aac2-52d811a288aa",
        "ordinal": 19,
        "start_byte": 686,
        "end_byte": 687,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "c19c9c82-b8e8-4d5a-986f-f55f7fc53201",
        "ordinal": 20,
        "start_byte": 687,
        "end_byte": 758,
        "text_sha256": "26fca3f0294a127c157567ceefa3442ce82d7b219863afa908e6be75d2098524",
        "text": "运行期间，每隔 5 min 记录一次亮度读数，单位为 lx。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "aa987d03-22da-4bdc-9ba7-ddf1786cf7fe",
        "ordinal": 21,
        "start_byte": 758,
        "end_byte": 759,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "aa25680b-941a-44de-b2b2-e68e2c8eb2aa",
        "ordinal": 22,
        "start_byte": 759,
        "end_byte": 869,
        "text_sha256": "4a2f2ef82692990b900cb67b68ec55a1f46aed0ed845816292cb955279ab523d",
        "text": "只有亮度读数连续两次低于 15 lx 时才标记为“待检查”；一次低值不触发该标记。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "553a904d-bd52-42df-977a-3fed9afc5ea3",
        "ordinal": 23,
        "start_byte": 869,
        "end_byte": 870,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "8e404bf7-1502-4233-bf12-f169e9e8f1a6",
        "ordinal": 24,
        "start_byte": 870,
        "end_byte": 901,
        "text_sha256": "23e11a8ac1bb1ea9e2650e588a20ebbb5e799680ac295ae8d4f88ed6b184c296",
        "text": "## 检查、停灯与缺失值\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "646c1ea1-1640-4b17-b2a8-caa14f30ec32",
        "ordinal": 25,
        "start_byte": 901,
        "end_byte": 902,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "e6ecdd0c-ad19-425a-8d45-6a7c57938367",
        "ordinal": 26,
        "start_byte": 902,
        "end_byte": 972,
        "text_sha256": "7e65c61c3299e7c64977deb5cf7aead15f384b308c047ac6ca2d07f310bb9f05",
        "text": "标记为“待检查”后，下一次启动前必须更换纸片。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "d156e308-045c-4a2e-a622-ea3dabe01ad9",
        "ordinal": 27,
        "start_byte": 972,
        "end_byte": 973,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "20911ca6-43c3-4a14-920a-c81d525f36e8",
        "ordinal": 28,
        "start_byte": 973,
        "end_byte": 1034,
        "text_sha256": "0a9deede8cd7fbac887642ad00ff2b42b6f04b0a6a3bd5bba23499a19d18182d",
        "text": "更换纸片后，必须手动清除“待检查”标记。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "2519f780-d3a2-4f7b-a8be-00c6d4e2e762",
        "ordinal": 29,
        "start_byte": 1034,
        "end_byte": 1035,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "dd3d28ca-9542-4d6c-97f1-49ee07635a25",
        "ordinal": 30,
        "start_byte": 1035,
        "end_byte": 1133,
        "text_sha256": "60c96fee1ad11b0e580eadd5bd3b5ae0ed0df00e457a08886ec85b821a3a297e",
        "text": "停灯后，应等待至少 3 min 再打开箱盖；紧急断电时也执行这一等待规则。\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "68099a4d-b4c7-43ba-a0ca-f830cfac8a8e",
        "ordinal": 31,
        "start_byte": 1133,
        "end_byte": 1134,
        "text_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
        "text": "\n"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text_span",
        "span_id": "c728bbe9-7e17-4017-94c2-e352d7f56e24",
        "ordinal": 32,
        "start_byte": 1134,
        "end_byte": 1208,
        "text_sha256": "a79cfd0f85a997a3e10460cd9b5b8d9512562f11a5710e00c44e9319a9ef935e",
        "text": "本材料没有给出主灯功率，不能将缺失功率填写为 0 W。\n"
      }
    ]
  },
